ing what he  just did  his betrayal of my trust in letting him  stay that i just shut down  nairo alleges that the next day zach  attempted to initiate sexual contact  again  and that after nairo refused zack  allegedly threatened to go public with  the information that the two had sex  and then blackmailed nairo into letting  zack perform oral sex on him nairo  alleges that the next month  at another smash tournament zak  attempted to blackmail nairo again  and after the two spoke zack apologized  and agreed to never speak about what  happened ever again  nairo also alleges that in may 2019 the  two spoke again  and zach offered to quote take the  bullet if the truth ever came out  nairo then alleges that in august 2019  zack asked him for money when his  sponsor polar ace dropped him following  the allegations about him blackmailing  ally came out  nairo says that he was reluctant to send  over the funds but  nairo also says that after he saw how  zack had blackmailed ally  he agreed to send over a total of 2 625  between august 2019 and february 2020.  nairo notes that zach himself has since  confessed that the hush money  allegations were false but  zack hasn't publicly admitted that  himself to meme released a twit longer  in september in which he shares  screenshots of what appears to be a  discord conversation he had had  with zack in which zac shares  screenshots of a text conversation he  appears to have had with nairo of him  asking for money hush money is not  mentioned in any of these screenshots  nairo ends his statement by accusing  zack of rape and blackmail  and says that while he feels his ousting  from the competitive smash scene is  unjust  he doesn't want to re-enter the  community right now so that's  a lot of heavy stuff zack has not  responded publicly since nairo's  statement  and nairo also says that he has a  30-page document including  evidence to support his case but he  didn't share that document publicly  notably some members of the sma